### TP0 - Requêtes de prise en main (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)

### Créer un livre
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 15.00
}

### Lister les livres
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books

### Détail d'un livre
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/1

### Message d'accueil (TP1)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/welcome

### Passer une commande (appel synchrone order -> catalog)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "customerId": "client-42"
}

### Lire une commande
GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/1

### Commande sur un livre inconnu -> 422
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 999, "quantity": 1, "customerId": "client-42" }
